---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="HEBBS Research"
  description="Research at HEBBS: building memory that learns for AI agents."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="border-b border-themed">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
      <p class="text-xs font-mono tracking-widest uppercase text-accent mb-6">HEBBS Research</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-6 max-w-3xl">
        Building memory that learns.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-themed-muted max-w-2xl">
        We study how AI agents should store, maintain, and retrieve knowledge over time. Our work draws from neuroscience, information retrieval, and systems engineering.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Publications -->
  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <h2 class="text-xs font-mono tracking-widest uppercase text-themed-muted mb-8">Publications</h2>

    <a href="/self-tuning-memory" class="block group">
      <div class="border border-themed rounded-xl p-6 md:p-8 hover:border-accent transition-colors">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between gap-4 mb-4">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold group-hover:text-accent transition-colors">
              HEBBS: A Self-Tuning Memory Engine for AI Agents
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-themed-muted mt-2">Parag Arora</p>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-themed-muted whitespace-nowrap">March 2026</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-themed-muted text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
          The first memory engine where agents evaluate their own retrieval, tune it per domain, and store strategies as memories. Six neuroscience-grounded maintenance mechanisms. 59% to 88% keyword recall via agent-driven tuning.
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mt-4">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2 py-1 rounded border border-themed text-themed-muted">Agent Memory</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2 py-1 rounded border border-themed text-themed-muted">Self-Tuning</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2 py-1 rounded border border-themed text-themed-muted">Neuroscience</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </a>
  </section>

  <!-- Research Areas -->
  <section class="border-t border-themed">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-mono tracking-widest uppercase text-themed-muted mb-8">Research Areas</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Self-Tuning Retrieval</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-themed-muted">Agents evaluate their own recall, tune parameters per domain, and store strategies as memories that strengthen through use.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Contradiction Detection</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-themed-muted">LLM-based structured classification into contradiction, revision, or dismiss categories with two-phase commit semantics.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Hebbian Associative Learning</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-themed-muted">Dual embeddings per memory with per-edge-type offset vectors enabling temporal, causal, and analogical reasoning.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Portable Cognition</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-themed-muted">File-first architecture separating source content from a rebuildable cognition layer. Build once, share everywhere.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Adaptive Decay</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-themed-muted">Ebbinghaus-curve forgetting with reinforcement capping. Recalled memories strengthen. Unreinforced memories fade.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Insight Consolidation</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-themed-muted">Sleep-like periodic clustering of episodes into scored semantic knowledge with full lineage tracking.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
